    <briefdescription>
<para>In-process backend that keeps values in a <computeroutput>std::map</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Default backend — no disk I/O, suitable for unit tests and small embedded deployments where RAM is not the bottleneck.</para>
<para>RAM cost = RAM index (~60 B/version) + values (payload size, typically 100–2000 B/version). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
